164
00:12:28,660 --> 00:12:31,860
Oh, my God.

165
00:13:17,740 --> 00:13:20,340
Have you noticed yet? Hey!

166
00:13:24,220 --> 00:13:26,437
Those little bastards.

167
00:13:26,520 --> 00:13:28,200
They really did it.

168
00:13:33,300 --> 00:13:35,660
She's gone now!

169
00:13:36,420 --> 00:13:38,200
I'll let her cry!

170
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:42,360
