171
00:13:42,620 --> 00:13:43,820
Wow, that's awesome!

172
00:13:49,420 --> 00:13:56,000
should we get ready kaido might
come that would be pointless

173
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:02,300
just hope it's luffy who comes back for us

174
00:14:06,680 --> 00:14:10,977
my energy is all spent i gave this

175
