time teaming up with Rox.

186
00:14:49,180 --> 00:14:51,180
Well, there's never a dull moment.

187
00:14:51,680 --> 00:14:54,660
I'll warn you, Rox is a good-for-nothing.

188
00:14:55,120 --> 00:14:57,660
You can't trust a word he says.

189
00:14:58,020 --> 00:15:00,255
You got a problem, you bring it to me.

190
00:15:01,160 --> 00:15:02,340
Mama, mama!

191
00:15:04,420 --> 00:15:06,300
The name's Lin-Lin.

192
00:15:07,020 --> 00:15:08,577
And don't you forget it.

193
00:15:08,660 --> 00:15:13,340
i'm gonna be king of these
seas welcome to the team

194
00:15:17,400 --> 00:15:23,620
looking back you and i have known each
other an awfully long time haven't we

195
