207
00:16:37,680 --> 00:16:39,780
Get this damn rubble off of me.

208
00:16:41,200 --> 00:16:42,457
Something is wrong.

209
00:16:42,540 --> 00:16:44,100
I feel so weak.

210
00:16:44,300 --> 00:16:45,594
Why can't I transform?

211
00:16:46,320 --> 00:16:47,680
Of course you can't.

212
00:16:48,900 --> 00:16:52,200
I couldn't have you using
your power, after all.

213
00:16:52,760 --> 00:16:58,080
