223
00:17:26,160 --> 00:17:27,997
That's beautiful, Hiyori.

224
00:17:28,080 --> 00:17:30,940
You've gotten so good at playing. Really?

225
00:17:31,260 --> 00:17:33,142
The song's called Moon Princess.

226
00:17:33,560 --> 00:17:35,640
