227
00:17:39,240 --> 00:17:40,860
Good. Keep it up.

228
00:17:41,220 --> 00:17:43,455
You can play it at my funeral someday.

229
00:17:49,740 --> 00:17:50,577
Hey, Momo.

230
00:17:50,660 --> 00:17:52,420
Stop making your sister cry.

231
00:17:52,660 --> 00:17:54,542
You're the one who made her cry.

232
00:17:55,180 --> 00:17:56,010
Me?

233
00:17:56,093 --> 00:17:56,923
The funeral thing?

234
00:17:57,006 --> 00:18:00,200
I'm sorry, it was only a joke.

235
00:18:01,180 --> 00:18:02,010
Promise?

236
00:18:04,220 --> 00:18:06,520
Like I die and leave you.

237
00:18:10,660 --> 00:18:13,440
My father loved this song as well.

238
00:18:14,040 --> 00:18:19,900
How peculiar that you would have
the same taste as Kozuki Oden.

239
00:18:20,820 --> 00:18:26,580
And now, every time I play it,
I remember my father's face.

240
00:18:31,560 --> 00:18:33,080
Your father?

241
00:18:33,960 --> 00:18:40,560
Knowing that, even as I avenge his
death, I dare not show a smile.

242
00:18:43,860 --> 00:18:45,980
Not in front of you!

243
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:11,620
I don't give a crap what
you guys had planned.

244
00:19:12,340 --> 00:19:15,380
The people of this country are starving.

245
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:18,960
You've taken enough from them!

246
00:19:20,020 --> 00:19:23,420
I'm giving this Scorpio
everything that I have left!

247
00:19:24,100 --> 00:19:28,660
And I won't stop attacking
until I put an end to you!

248
00:19:33,820 --> 00:19:37,040
I can't tell where these
attacks are coming from!

249
00:19:46,380 --> 00:19:48,320
You're leaving this country!

250
00:19:48,620 --> 00:19:49,960
I'll make sure of it!

251
00:19:50,280 --> 00:19:51,900
Wano doesn't need you!

252
00:19:52,300 --> 00:19:54,200
I'm kicking you out!
